*******************************************************************
**  Specification Of Material Properties
*******************************************************************
**
**	UNITS:	Length - mili-meters (10^-3)
**		Time - sec
**		Angle - radians
**		Temperature - Kelvins
**		Force - mili-Newtons (10^-3)
**		Stress - mili-Newton/mili-meter^2 = kPa (10^3)
**		Mass - Grams
**		Density -g/mili-meter^3 = 1e3Kg/meter^3 (10^6)
**		Conductivity - mili-Watt/mili-m-K
**		Specific Heat - micro-J/mili-m^3-K	(10^-3)		
**		Energy - micro-Joules			(10^-6)
**	        Chemical potential - micro-Joules/nano-mole (10^3)
**		Fluid content - moles/volume
**
*******************************************************************
**
** use with the following subroutines:
**	1) uel_elasticGel.for
**
*******************************************************************
